think wrote a fresh ep013 witness file by hand, modeled on ep012 -- it ran GREEN, but a system-reminder flagged the file had changed on disk since my read: `git log` showed it was already landed by an earlier "tools: land e70 IronBeetle ep013" commit with the correct episode number (e70, not my guessed e69) and different prose. git checkout -- restored the original rather than keeping my overwrite
